#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:2
msgid "Native dense-Ising solver"
msgstr "本地稠密 Ising 求解器"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:4
msgid ""
"QuSpect includes a local C++ reference backend for the exact matrix consumed "
"by :class:`~quspect.optimization.hardware.HardwareIsingProgram`.  It "
"minimizes"
msgstr ""
"QuSpect 为 :class:`~quspect.optimization.hardware.HardwareIsingProgram` "
"所接收的确切矩阵提供了一个本地 C++ 参考后端。它对下式进行最小化"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:7
msgid "E(s) = -s^\\mathsf{T} M s,\\qquad s_i\\in\\{-1,+1\\},"
msgstr "E(s) = -s^\\mathsf{T} M s,\\qquad s_i\\in\\{-1,+1\\},"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:11
msgid ""
"where ``M`` is finite, symmetric, dense, and has a zero diagonal.  This "
"keeps the local and future remote-hardware boundaries identical."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``M`` 的元素有限、矩阵对称且稠密，并且对角线为零。这样可以使本地"
"硬件边界与未来的远程硬件边界保持一致。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:15
msgid "Algorithm selection"
msgstr "算法选择"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:17
msgid ""
"The first implementation uses Metropolis simulated annealing with "
"independent multi-start reads.  This is the most suitable baseline for an "
"arbitrary dense floating-point matrix:"
msgstr ""
"首个实现采用 Metropolis 模拟退火，并进行多次相互独立的随机重启。对于"
"任意稠密浮点矩阵，这是最合适的基准实现："

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:21
msgid ""
"The Metropolis acceptance rule comes from `Metropolis et al. (1953) <https://"
"doi.org/10.1063/1.1699114>`_, and its optimization interpretation follows "
"`Kirkpatrick, Gelatt, and Vecchi (1983) <https://doi.org/10.1126/"
"science.220.4598.671>`_."
msgstr ""
"Metropolis 接受准则源自 `Metropolis 等人（1953） <https://"
"doi.org/10.1063/1.1699114>`_，其优化含义遵循 "
"`Kirkpatrick、Gelatt 和 Vecchi（1983） <https://doi.org/10.1126/"
"science.220.4598.671>`_。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:25
msgid ""
"`Isakov et al. <https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.1084>`_ demonstrate much faster "
"multi-spin-coded variants for sparse, bounded-degree models with discrete "
"couplings.  Those assumptions do not hold for the dense, arbitrary-double "
"hardware IR, so QuSpect uses the generic local-field method instead."
msgstr ""
"`Isakov 等人 <https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.1084>`_ 针对具有离散耦合的稀疏"
"有界度模型，展示了速度快得多的多自旋编码变体。稠密且使用任意双精度值的"
"硬件 IR 并不满足这些假设，因此 QuSpect 改用通用的局部场方法。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:29
msgid ""
"The `D-Wave samplers reference implementation <https://github.com/"
"dwavesystems/dwave-samplers>`_ likewise defines a sweep as one update per "
"spin over a decreasing-temperature schedule.  It provides a useful "
"independent API and algorithm reference."
msgstr ""
"`D-Wave 采样器参考实现 <https://github.com/"
"dwavesystems/dwave-samplers>`_ 同样将一次扫描定义为：在逐步降温的调度"
"过程中，每个自旋更新一次。它为 API 和算法提供了有用的独立参考。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:33
msgid ""
"Fujitsu's Digital Annealer uses parallel-trial updates and a dynamic escape "
"mechanism on specialized fully connected CMOS hardware; see `Aramon et al. "
"(2019) <https://doi.org/10.3389/fphy.2019.00048>`_.  Evaluating all trials "
"in parallel is attractive for a later SIMD/GPU backend, but it does not map "
"to a portable CPU baseline without that hardware parallelism."
msgstr ""
"富士通 Digital Annealer 在专用的全连接 CMOS 硬件上采用并行试探更新和"
"动态逃逸机制；参见 `Aramon 等人（2019） <https://doi.org/10.3389/"
"fphy.2019.00048>`_。对所有试探进行并行求值很适合未来的 SIMD/GPU 后端，"
"但在缺少此类硬件并行能力时，无法直接映射为可移植的 CPU 基准实现。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:38
msgid ""
"Parallel tempering can cross barriers more effectively by exchanging "
"replicas at different temperatures, as introduced by `Hukushima and Nemoto "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/9512035>`_.  It is a future solver option "
"because it adds a temperature-ladder and exchange-policy surface beyond the "
"minimal hardware-compatible API."
msgstr ""
"并行回火通过交换处于不同温度的副本，可以更有效地跨越势垒；该方法由 "
"`Hukushima 和 Nemoto <https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/9512035>`_ 提出。"
"它可作为未来的求解器选项，因为除了最小的硬件兼容 API 以外，它还会引入"
"温度阶梯和交换策略接口。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:45
msgid "Incremental update"
msgstr "增量更新"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:47
msgid "For a symmetric zero-diagonal matrix, define the cached local field"
msgstr "对于对角线为零的对称矩阵，将缓存的局部场定义为"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:49
msgid "f_i = \\sum_j M_{ij}s_j."
msgstr "f_i = \\sum_j M_{ij}s_j."

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:53
msgid "Flipping spin ``i`` changes the energy by"
msgstr "翻转自旋 ``i`` 会使能量发生如下变化"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:55
msgid "\\Delta E_i = 4s_i f_i."
msgstr "\\Delta E_i = 4s_i f_i."

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:59
msgid ""
"Rejected proposals therefore cost constant time.  After an accepted flip "
"from the old value ``s_i``, every field is updated as"
msgstr ""
"因此，被拒绝的候选翻转只需要常数时间。接受从旧值 ``s_i`` 开始的翻转后，"
"每个局部场按下式更新"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:62
msgid "f_j \\leftarrow f_j - 2M_{ji}s_i,"
msgstr "f_j \\leftarrow f_j - 2M_{ji}s_i,"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:66
msgid ""
"which costs :math:`O(N)`.  Initial energy and fields cost :math:`O(N^2)`. A "
"sweep attempts ``N`` flips and costs between :math:`O(N)` and :math:`O(N^2)` "
"depending on the acceptance rate.  Independent reads are parallelized with "
"OpenMP when available."
msgstr ""
"其开销为 :math:`O(N)`。初始化能量和局部场的开销为 :math:`O(N^2)`。一次"
"扫描会尝试 ``N`` 次翻转，其开销随接受率而变化，介于 :math:`O(N)` 与 "
":math:`O(N^2)` 之间。OpenMP 可用时，相互独立的求解会被并行执行。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:71
msgid ""
"Each read derives its own RNG seed solely from ``(base_seed, read_index)`` "
"and writes to a fixed result slot.  Thread scheduling therefore cannot "
"change the result.  All reads, including duplicates, are retained and stably "
"sorted by ascending energy."
msgstr ""
"每次求解都仅根据 ``(base_seed, read_index)`` 推导其自身的 RNG 种子，并"
"写入固定的结果槽位。因此，线程调度不会改变结果。所有求解结果（包括重复"
"结果）都会被保留，并按能量升序进行稳定排序。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:77
msgid "Exact oracle"
msgstr "精确预言机"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:79
msgid ""
"The native test oracle enumerates small models in binary-reflected Gray-code "
"order.  Consecutive configurations differ by one spin, so it reuses the same "
"local-field update rather than recomputing every quadratic energy.  Its time "
"complexity is :math:`O(N2^N)` and memory complexity is :math:`O(N^2)`; "
"``max_spins`` defaults to 24 to prevent accidental exponential runs."
msgstr ""
"原生测试预言机按照二进制反射格雷码顺序枚举小规模模型。相邻配置仅有一个"
"自旋不同，因此它复用相同的局部场更新，而不重新计算每一个二次能量。其时间"
"复杂度为 :math:`O(N2^N)`，空间复杂度为 :math:`O(N^2)`；``max_spins`` "
"默认为 24，以防止意外执行指数级计算。"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:86
msgid "Python API"
msgstr "Python API"

#: ../../source/ising_solver.rst:105
msgid ""
"``result.hardware_samples`` preserves the exact matrix-column order. "
"``result.logical_samples`` applies gauge normalization and removes auxiliary "
"spins through the hardware program's decode metadata. "
"``result.objective_values`` restores the logical Ising objective supplied to "
"hardware lowering.  It therefore includes compiled penalties when the input "
"came from a constrained ``QuadraticProgram``; evaluate the retained "
"``CompilationResult`` to obtain the original business objective."
msgstr ""
"``result.hardware_samples`` 保持确切的矩阵列顺序。"
"``result.logical_samples`` 通过硬件程序的解码元数据应用规范归一化，并"
"移除辅助自旋。``result.objective_values`` 恢复提供给硬件降级层的逻辑 "
"Ising 目标。因此，当输入来自受约束的 ``QuadraticProgram`` 时，其中包含"
"已编译的惩罚项；应对保留的 ``CompilationResult`` 求值，以获得原始业务"
"目标。"
